span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          这只是今年测到的新产品之一，也是俺新晋最爱榜单之一，很水果糖的感觉，还有莓果巧克力，整体从热到冷都很甜美，细腻，低温时有一阵子的感受还像小熊软糖的香气和酸甜，好棒～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;\">\n           品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n           处理方式：鲜果热冲击后厌氧水洗 Cherry Thermo-shocked Anaerobic Washed\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          风味：花香、橙子、绿葡萄、茉莉绿茶\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          Floral, Orange, Green grape, Jasmine-tea like\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          这也是新晋最爱榜单之一，这是我们第一次拿到核桃树的瑰夏，整体很清新细腻，没有Wushwush或者我们四重奏里的品种那种强度很高很水果或者很发酵带来的酸感，入口是很饱满的甜，像橙子和沃柑的那种甜中带酸，然后出来绿葡萄的果香，淡淡的附和着甜感的感受，还有一些轻轻的茉莉绿茶香，挺好的！非常推荐大家试一下！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          很有趣的是，我在上海测的时候风味的感受就是\n          <span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           花香橙子绿葡萄和茉莉绿\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          茶，但前面一周在云南海拔700多米的基地冲，用了相对粗的研磨快冲，就出现了不一样的细腻的香气，居然有具象的树莓和玫瑰香葡萄香气，再一次给我在相比上海高海拔的地方冲出来更多花果香气的经验库+1～\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理细节：（这两个产品的处理方式相同，但是会有不同的发酵液）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            鲜果浮选筛选瑕疵\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            鲜果放入80摄氏度热水中进行热冲击20秒，然后放入冷水中冷却3-5分钟\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            鲜果脱皮，用特制的脱皮机脱皮时从果胶中提取中更多的糖液\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            脱皮后的豆子带着部分果胶，加入之前预留的同品种发酵液进行厌氧发酵\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            晾晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZFrN2aO0ngM54ScIHTqGicjcyic7N0hC2gjO1lePJeLdzQzrso7Ofq73AEh7QXt5HciaJAXN5EKv0g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SVRVOK3WTnORFVdeWqK38N9rI0j5CxKib09adQa29wHSY24DvxUBqGP5EKP4hF9OFAiaXFVT5Kianpg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QSwNjfeX4MyxbVUDe0W3VUYFm2kBkLCEiaLictSH50ME9eAmjS2lIL1hLEia2frcfu3whYVgsQiccicTg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          白色桶的装的就是特定的咖啡果脱皮时收集的果胶“糖”液\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于Finca Los Nogales\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Los Nogales建立于1952年，由Hernandez家族所拥有，位于慧兰省的Cisne镇，11公顷的面积里有6公顷是自然保育区，有一些稀有的哺乳动物，鸟类栖息，5公顷种植咖啡；最初种植卡杜拉，也凭借一支传统水洗处理的卡杜拉赢得了2005年哥伦比亚北部区域CoE竞赛的第一名；现在第三代Oscar Hernandez负责打理，从小它就是8个兄弟姐妹里对咖啡最感兴趣的那一个，不上学的时候他总喜欢在咖啡田里，处理厂上跑，边玩边学着各种咖啡知识；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SVRVOK3WTnORFVdeWqK38NKnSLBHauR5FB0uxArlOE0hB977aeE1mnTia58g8S2UnzbLyJjlshtTQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          2005年的成名，让Hernandez家庭因为咖啡在当时当地名利双收，日本的丸山咖啡成为了Nogales的最大客户，随后几年随着丸山的采购也让Nogales的经济收益逐年提高，悲伤的是，成名让整个家庭成为了当地的游击队的目标，2013年，父亲\n          <span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n           Ricaurte Hernández被游击队绑架，不甘于妥协也不想让刚刚走上幸福路的家庭缴纳大笔赎金而一夜回到解放前，父亲选择了自杀式的反抗，还在参军中的Oscar一夜之间做了人生中的重要决定，回家接起父亲的担子，那年Oscar 24岁。\n          </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SVRVOK3WTnORFVdeWqK38NeKMia4cvjnqwbqS8RoLFDX074JvIRm0pq9cwAVibWNPdwFMqcv19AqWg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          对质量的追求与不妥协，对未知事务的好奇和探索，Oscar将Nogales做的越来越好，他的目标就是要让父亲为他自豪，不满足于评分表上的高分，而是要让Nogales成为哥伦比亚的领军，他个人也想能进入哥伦比亚生产者协会FNC的理事，能成为对哥伦比亚咖啡有举足轻重影响力的人。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
